Thus we need to express condition without calling methods on lb. Could use the fact that the returned BitSet's toLongArray length equals the number of non-zero words read from buffer? The comment says "each element in the long array representation of the returned BitSet matches the corresponding element in the LongBuffer from its current position to its limit." So we need to assert equality for each element.

